/-- In `(ZMod p)⟦X⟧`, `qPochInfPS^p = qPochInfPS.expand p` (Frobenius applied to inverse). -/
theorem qPochInfPS_pow_eq_expand (p : Nat) [Fact (Nat.Prime p)] (hp : p ≠ 0) :
    (qPochInfPS (ZMod p)) ^ p =
