4. **Key trick** (Hirschhorn): `(J_0+J_1+J_3+J_6+J_{10})^4 = ((qPoch)^3)^4 =
   (qPoch)^{12} = (qPoch)^{11} · qPoch ≡ (expand 11 qPoch) · qPoch (mod 11)`.

